=== Cursor Position Basics ===
Cursor at offset 0: {0, 0}
Cursor at offset 7: {0, 7}
Cursor at offset 15 (end): {0, 15}

=== Multi-line Cursor ===
Line 1 start (offset 0): {0, 0}
Line 1 end (offset 3): {1, 3}
Line 2 start (offset 4): {1, 4}
Line 3 start (offset 11): {2, 4}

=== Cursor Offset Conversions ===
Offset 0 -> Position {0, 0}
Offset 1 -> Position {0, 1}
Offset 2 -> Position {0, 2}
Offset 3 -> Position {0, 3}

=== Max Cursor Position ===
"VfL" max cursor: {0, 3}
"A\nB\nC" max cursor: {2, 1}
